{"title":"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> be a subset of consecutive elements of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/c/d2c469a2bc6bdbbe6569db69002aaa3553b82dd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\{n, n+1, \\ldots, n+999\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"215\" height=\"18\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive integer. Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b111ba1d1224d42c09c27aee43f26be3540ccac9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mu(A) = \\sum_{k \\in A} \\tau(k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"125\" height=\"39\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/b/f6bca5ee6c1c6c360b4a7b5efc02ee9dc60cd78e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tau(k) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> has an odd number of divisors and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e11239192115678961d3ab5a3714649b2164425d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tau(k) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> has an even number of divisors. For how many <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/3/a730c57d195380061aff83b0aab3d0de5288bc84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\le 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"16\" /> does there exist an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/7/4d7f1b49ac64cbe98571e19d1c34a6b2b6a52ee2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|A| = 620$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/d/a5d213d95bdaa5fd820519512537b3489324cc0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mu(A) = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" />? (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/6/29680a0e11fad163e3a724436f78a84ae70d098a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|X|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" /> denotes the cardinality of the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, or the number of elements in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/4/c14026b461e5c8f1ac2f1dfa61b92f9179353a1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tau(k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"36\" height=\"20\" /> to equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> must be a perfect square. The amount of perfect squares in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/2/5c2d225f91a6d096ace171dd01501ea190dd61d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor \\sqrt{n+999} \\rfloor - \\lceil \\sqrt{n} \\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"158\" height=\"23\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/d/b9d3848023be8e2ab18aea8b765b1d885f35e446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mu(S)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"20\" />. For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> not to satisfy one of the two mentioned conditions, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/d/b9d3848023be8e2ab18aea8b765b1d885f35e446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mu(S)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"20\" /> needs to be greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f7d5e0b260956eeb35eca23f90e4378df04ee0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$392$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, in order for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/c/67c879422e3ccaf369f48846c7f713f0647b4715.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mu(A)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> to always be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/d/b9d3848023be8e2ab18aea8b765b1d885f35e446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mu(S)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"20\" /> needs to be less than 11. As far as I can tell, these are always satisfied for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/3/a730c57d195380061aff83b0aab3d0de5288bc84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\le 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"16\" />, meaning all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/3/a730c57d195380061aff83b0aab3d0de5288bc84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\le 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"16\" />, so there always exists an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> that satisfies both conditions in the problem. This means that the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/b/5eb1e801d6a7cf996c23c4c9ae38c42371f676c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"46\" height=\"24\" />. I don’t know how to prove this, but I plugged the equations into Desmos and saw no solutions. (I know this isn’t a valid AIME answer, but please correct me if I am wrong. This is my first solution on AoPS!)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006\">Mock AIME 5 2005-2006</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=76847\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018040431\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 228/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1445/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 203/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5521/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.168      1 Template:Mock_AIME_box\n100.00%    7.168      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13376:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018040431 and revision id 284607. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}